WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.672 --> 00:00:03.722
- Whoo, when you have a
sub, it's like a free day.

00:00:03.722 --> 00:00:05.418
Your teacher's gone.

00:00:05.418 --> 00:00:07.504
They're not gonna know what you did.

00:00:07.504 --> 00:00:09.898
Even if they do, they're
not gonna know who it was

00:00:09.898 --> 00:00:13.231
'cause the sub doesn't know who you are.

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:18.311
- If a substitute teacher
walks into the classroom

00:00:18.311 --> 00:00:21.284
like this and kind of ready for defeat,

00:00:21.284 --> 00:00:23.367
they will be eaten alive.

00:00:24.348 --> 00:00:27.288
This guy looked like really disheveled.

00:00:27.288 --> 00:00:29.149
His tie and buttons were always loose

00:00:29.149 --> 00:00:31.429
and hair flying, the
little hair that he had,

00:00:31.429 --> 00:00:32.646
was like everywhere.

00:00:32.646 --> 00:00:35.139
I was blatantly not paying attention,

00:00:35.139 --> 00:00:37.822
and he actually had decided to call me out

00:00:37.822 --> 00:00:40.005
in front of the rest of the class.

00:00:40.005 --> 00:00:44.834
And I was like, "Oh, sorry,
this is really boring

00:00:44.834 --> 00:00:46.519
"and you're not capturing our attention."

00:00:46.519 --> 00:00:48.429
And he was like, "Oh, okay,
so you have a lot to say.

00:00:48.429 --> 00:00:49.921
"You're a big mouth; come
to the front of the class."

00:00:49.921 --> 00:00:51.332
And I was like, "Okay, sounds good."

00:00:51.332 --> 00:00:52.876
And he goes, "If you
talk back to me again,

00:00:52.876 --> 00:00:55.398
"I'm gonna give you a detention slip."

00:00:55.398 --> 00:00:57.318
And I said, "You can't
give me a detention slip.

00:00:57.318 --> 00:00:58.449
"You're a substitute teacher.

00:00:58.449 --> 00:01:01.362
"I'll just rip it up and
that's it; it'll be fine."

00:01:01.362 --> 00:01:03.094
And he goes, "Oh, well
since you're so confident

00:01:03.094 --> 00:01:04.549
"about your future, why don't you tell me

00:01:04.549 --> 00:01:06.168
"what else is gonna
happen in your future?"

00:01:06.168 --> 00:01:08.772
And I went like this over
his head like a crystal.

00:01:08.772 --> 00:01:11.659
And I said, "Oh, let me
see what's in my future."

00:01:11.659 --> 00:01:13.751
And he was like, "You gotta
get the fuck out of here.

00:01:13.751 --> 00:01:15.393
"Go to in-school suspension."

00:01:15.393 --> 00:01:17.399
He was so mad that I'd
pointed out the fact

00:01:17.399 --> 00:01:18.502
that he was bald.

00:01:18.502 --> 00:01:20.094
I had everyone in the class laughing.

00:01:20.094 --> 00:01:23.184
When Mr. Sutton, my social
studies full time teacher,

00:01:23.184 --> 00:01:26.184
came back, he had asked me what happened.

00:01:26.184 --> 00:01:27.386
I told him the whole story.

00:01:27.386 --> 00:01:29.512
I could tell that he was
holding back laughter.

00:01:29.512 --> 00:01:32.762
And he gave me like an extra detention.

00:01:34.533 --> 00:01:37.302
He's like, "That's hysterical,
but you still have detention.

00:01:37.302 --> 00:01:38.356
"That's awful."

00:01:38.356 --> 00:01:39.687
And I was like, "Okay, fair enough.

00:01:39.687 --> 00:01:41.276
"Good, I'm glad you think it's funny,

00:01:41.276 --> 00:01:43.584
but I deserve it so cool."

00:01:43.584 --> 00:01:46.751
- So he was short, and he
just seemed very nerdy.

00:01:46.751 --> 00:01:48.643
We just knew, everybody
was looking at each other,

00:01:48.643 --> 00:01:50.389
we knew that something was gonna happen

00:01:50.389 --> 00:01:51.647
within that 40 minutes.

00:01:51.647 --> 00:01:53.598
We didn't think that we
were really gonna have

00:01:53.598 --> 00:01:55.437
any work to do 'cause
usually when subs come

00:01:55.437 --> 00:01:57.572
they give you super easy work.

00:01:57.572 --> 00:01:59.490
And this teacher was telling us,

00:01:59.490 --> 00:02:01.726
"Yeah, here's an assignment
that you're gonna do.

00:02:01.726 --> 00:02:03.432
"You need to have it done
by the end of class."

00:02:03.432 --> 00:02:04.973
We're like, "We're not doing this."

00:02:04.973 --> 00:02:06.596
We were trying to think
of different things

00:02:06.596 --> 00:02:07.660
we could come up with.

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:09.733
And my friends were like,
"Brianna, you should

00:02:09.733 --> 00:02:11.006
"maybe fake an asthma attack."

00:02:11.006 --> 00:02:13.583
And I don't know why I thought this was

00:02:13.583 --> 00:02:15.325
gonna be a good idea.

00:02:15.325 --> 00:02:16.772
And so what we thought was gonna happen

00:02:16.772 --> 00:02:17.988
was I was gonna fake it.

00:02:17.988 --> 00:02:19.747
And he was gonna be like,
"Okay, a student's sick.

00:02:19.747 --> 00:02:20.917
"Go to the nurse."

00:02:20.917 --> 00:02:22.612
But no, he called 911.

00:02:22.612 --> 00:02:24.359
I'm in the corner hiding my face

00:02:24.359 --> 00:02:25.942
so he can't see what's going on.

00:02:25.942 --> 00:02:28.262
Some of my friends came
over to the corner as well,

00:02:28.262 --> 00:02:29.833
and they're like, "Okay, just act like

00:02:29.833 --> 00:02:31.346
"you're still having
a hard time breathing.

00:02:31.346 --> 00:02:32.457
"We'll give you your inhaler."

00:02:32.457 --> 00:02:33.729
And so I started calming down.

00:02:33.729 --> 00:02:35.282
I was like, "Oh, my God,
I think it's going away.

00:02:35.282 --> 00:02:36.662
"I think it was a false alarm."

00:02:36.662 --> 00:02:38.310
He's like, "No, you still
need to see the ambulance."

00:02:38.310 --> 00:02:40.290
When the ambulance came,
I explained to them.

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:41.843
I was like, "I took my
inhaler, and I think

00:02:41.843 --> 00:02:42.734
"I'm just feeling better.

00:02:42.734 --> 00:02:43.567
"It's fine."

00:02:43.567 --> 00:02:45.271
And they checked on me and everything,

00:02:45.271 --> 00:02:46.401
and they're like, "Everything's okay."

00:02:46.401 --> 00:02:49.052
Also should mention my dad was
my principal in high school

00:02:49.052 --> 00:02:54.008
as well, so none of this was
a smart idea for me to do.

00:02:54.008 --> 00:02:56.740
And I knew, and my dad knows
me obviously, I'm his daughter.

00:02:56.740 --> 00:03:00.240
He knew I was not having an asthma attack.

00:03:01.411 --> 00:03:06.358
- The sub was a very kind of
buttoned-up nerdy looking guy.

00:03:06.358 --> 00:03:08.454
So when you're in elementary
school, one of the things

00:03:08.454 --> 00:03:10.907
you almost always do is go around reading.

00:03:10.907 --> 00:03:12.505
Where one person reads a paragraph

00:03:12.505 --> 00:03:14.043
and the next person reads a paragraph.

00:03:14.043 --> 00:03:16.143
When we had a sub and
it was my turn to read,

00:03:16.143 --> 00:03:18.958
I'd always fake like I
couldn't real very well.

00:03:18.958 --> 00:03:21.403
And I could read really
well, but I would pretend

00:03:21.403 --> 00:03:22.348
like I couldn't.

00:03:22.348 --> 00:03:24.924
And my friends and everyone
else in the class would laugh

00:03:24.924 --> 00:03:26.174
knowing that I was faking it.

00:03:26.174 --> 00:03:27.708
But the teacher would get mad at them

00:03:27.708 --> 00:03:29.946
thinking they were making fun of me.

00:03:29.946 --> 00:03:32.183
And so then I would have to pretend like

00:03:32.183 --> 00:03:34.592
I was being made fun of.

00:03:34.592 --> 00:03:37.616
We kept it going too long,
and I kept laughing too.

00:03:37.616 --> 00:03:40.192
And the substitute teacher
finally caught onto it

00:03:40.192 --> 00:03:42.976
that I was faking with him
and that I could read well.

00:03:42.976 --> 00:03:44.537
And in retrospect, it
was really bad because

00:03:44.537 --> 00:03:46.274
there were kids who couldn't read well,

00:03:46.274 --> 00:03:48.774
and they probably felt shitty.

00:03:49.776 --> 00:03:52.930
- So my brother who is about
two grades older than me

00:03:52.930 --> 00:03:54.774
gave me a fart machine.

00:03:54.774 --> 00:03:57.063
It was about this big
with a remote control.

00:03:57.063 --> 00:03:58.947
And in our class rooms, for some reason,

00:03:58.947 --> 00:04:01.703
there was a bathroom
at the back of class .

00:04:01.703 --> 00:04:04.023
So on a normal day, you
would here a few things

00:04:04.023 --> 00:04:05.230
coming from the bathroom.

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:07.798
But I took the fart
machine in because we knew

00:04:07.798 --> 00:04:09.461
we were gonna have a
substitute teacher that day.

00:04:09.461 --> 00:04:11.384
And I went into the bathroom and just

00:04:11.384 --> 00:04:12.708
let off a few rips.

00:04:12.708 --> 00:04:15.892
She was older, definitely
grandma level age.

00:04:15.892 --> 00:04:17.776
Yeah, I think she didn't
realize she was coming

00:04:17.776 --> 00:04:18.950
to middle school that day.

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:20.997
I think she probably was
expecting an elementary class,

00:04:20.997 --> 00:04:22.961
and she was in for a rude awakening.

00:04:22.961 --> 00:04:25.585
I did it probably about
three of the fart noises.

00:04:25.585 --> 00:04:27.605
They were varied fart noises.

00:04:27.605 --> 00:04:28.960
The first two were pretty mild,

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:33.424
but then there was one that
was such an unbelievable fart.

00:04:33.424 --> 00:04:35.625
It just kind of went on for awhile.

00:04:35.625 --> 00:04:36.857
My classmates sold me out.

00:04:36.857 --> 00:04:38.311
When I walked out,
everybody just turned around

00:04:38.311 --> 00:04:39.669
and started laughing at me.

00:04:39.669 --> 00:04:42.412
And so the teacher asked
if I made any noises

00:04:42.412 --> 00:04:43.500
while I was in there.

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:45.548
And I tried to say that it was Mexican

00:04:45.548 --> 00:04:48.460
from the night before, but she
saw the bulge in my pocket.

00:04:48.460 --> 00:04:50.821
So after I presented it,
she made me push the button

00:04:50.821 --> 00:04:51.856
in front of class.

00:04:51.856 --> 00:04:53.349
And of course, another fart came out.

00:04:53.349 --> 00:04:54.682
The whole class laughed.

00:04:54.682 --> 00:04:57.487
She took the fart machine
away and had my mom

00:04:57.487 --> 00:04:59.070
come in and get it.

00:05:00.084 --> 00:05:01.930
So, that was kind of annoying.

00:05:01.930 --> 00:05:03.099
My mom has a great sense of humor anyway

00:05:03.099 --> 00:05:04.325
so she kind of loved it.

00:05:04.325 --> 00:05:05.555
And I'm pretty sure she
took the fart machine

00:05:05.555 --> 00:05:08.055
into work and used it herself.

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:10.935
- Now that I'm an adult, I have friends

00:05:10.935 --> 00:05:12.485
that are school teachers,
and I know how hard it is.

00:05:12.485 --> 00:05:14.091
So I would say, "Give yourself a break."

00:05:14.091 --> 00:05:17.781
- Don't be, I'm not gonna
curse, but a little brat.

00:05:17.781 --> 00:05:18.822
Don't be a brat.

00:05:18.822 --> 00:05:22.709
- They're just there to take
over for your original teacher.

00:05:22.709 --> 00:05:25.356
- Mister Substitute Teacher...

00:05:25.356 --> 00:05:28.228
- I don't really remember
your name, but I'm sorry.

00:05:28.228 --> 00:05:30.322
- I definitely feel bad about what I did.

00:05:30.322 --> 00:05:32.025
- I'm really sorry.

00:05:32.025 --> 00:05:32.858
I'm sorry.

00:05:32.858 --> 00:05:34.447
- I apologize; I did lie.

00:05:34.447 --> 00:05:37.128
I did not in fact have
Mexican food the night before.

00:05:37.128 --> 00:05:39.128
- I'm not really sorry.

